      }
    },
    "image_with_text_J6Jx8R": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_gA3wLe": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Targeting your ideal audience isn't just serving your ads to them, it's resonating with them.</p><p><br/>• Resonating with your ideal customer sits in what we say to them, how we speak to them, and how we visually relate to their interests to turn our offer from an interest<br/>to a need.<br/>• Afterall...Good marketing makes your brand look smart, but great marketing makes the customer feel smart.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text_gA3wLe"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "section_heading": "ASK YOURSELF:",
        "section_sub_heading": "<p>\"What are the top 5 reasons why someone would be interested in your offer but not purchase?”</p>",
        "sub_image_text": "",
        "section_heading_size": "h1",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Awareness_4.jpg",
        "height": "adapt",
        "desktop_image_width": "medium",
        "layout": "image_first",
        "desktop_content_position": "top",
        "desktop_content_alignment": "left",
        "content_layout": "no-overlap",
        "color_scheme": "background-1",
        "image_behavior": "none",
        "mobile_content_alignment": "left",
        "padding_top": 36,
        "padding_bottom": 36
      }
    },
    "image_with_text_tCNVk8": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_kkx6Dg": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>When planning creative efforts, our process includes asking ourselves these main questions in relation to every piece of content we make:</p><ul><li> Are we making what we are selling obvious?</li><li>Are we clear about the problem we are solving?</li><li>Is there urgency in the message? (optional but helps)</li><li>How are we making the purchase decision easy?</li><li>What do we want to learn from this creative?</li><li>Who are we targeting with the ad, and how is the creative relatable to that audience?</li></ul><ol><li>Are we applying messaging relatable to their interest?</li><li>How will they remember the way we speak to them?</li><li>Is our tone believable and not too exaggerated?</li></ol><ul><li>What is different about this ad from every other ad we’ve run, and what will we learn from that difference?</li><li>Is our landing page reflective of the audience we are targeting? Is the experience from the ad to the landing page congruent?</li></ul>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        },
        "button_FmGY7b": {
          "type": "button",
          "settings": {
            "button_label": "LEARN MORE >>",
            "button_link": "shopify://pages/content-creation"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text_kkx6Dg",
        "button_FmGY7b"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "section_heading": "CONTENT NEEDS PURPOSE",
        "section_sub_heading": "<p>Content is King. It’s true, but your content doesn't need a massive budget to get the results you need. Reduce that risk with a smarter approach to content.<br/></p><p>Too many brands fail to be effective with their creative efforts because their ads lack purpose.</p>",
        "sub_image_text": "<p>We have learned the key to success is behind what we are learning from our creative. Too many brands make the mistake of making content that isn't designed with a purpose or learning in addition to converting. We can confidently say it doesn't take a huge investment in big production.</p>",
        "section_heading_size": "h1",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Content_Shoot.jpg",
        "height": "adapt",
        "desktop_image_width": "medium",
        "layout": "image_first",
        "desktop_content_position": "top",
        "desktop_content_alignment": "left",
        "content_layout": "no-overlap",
        "color_scheme": "background-1",
        "image_behavior": "none",
        "mobile_content_alignment": "left",
        "padding_top": 36,
        "padding_bottom": 0
      }
    },
    "custom_tabs_BeV8rj": {
      "type": "custom-tabs",
      "disabled": true,
      "settings": {
        "heading": "WHAT WE CAN DO FOR YOU",
        "heading_size": "h2",
        "sub_heading": "We are an extension of your team that helps with the strategy of ad content and handles the distribution of ads to help better understand your customers through a comprehensive ad funnel experience applying data-backed decisions. Ad buying is so much more than paying for ad space to get in front of customers, hoping to drive sales with a profitable return. Anyone can create ads and target who you might think is your audience, but success is much more complicated than that. Every successful marketer understands that it’s a game of buying data. There is something to gain from winners and losers. All can be steps in the right direction. We want to make sense of every bit of data we collect and better understand our customers and what speaks to them. We do this to create an experience for those connecting with your brand. Our team knows how to make sense of every action a visitor takes from your ads through your site. There’s a science to it. So please think of us as an extension of your team because, at Mpire Media, you get a hive mind of top-tier marketing minds for less than what it would cost you to hire a single in-house media buyer.",
        "color_scheme": "background-1",
        "full_width": false,
        "padding_top": 40,
        "padding_bottom": 52
      }
    },
